{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>See.</b> See with your own eyes that YHWH in His glory is warning you about the Sabbath — for a miracle is done every Sabbath eve to give you a double portion of bread." "<b>Remain each man in his place.</b> From here the Sages derived four cubits for one who goes beyond the Sabbath limit (Eruvin 51)." "<b>Let no man go out from his place.</b> These are the two thousand cubits of the Sabbath limit (Mekhilta) — and not explicitly stated, for the Sabbath limits are only from rabbinic law. The essential meaning of the verse is spoken concerning the gatherers of the manna."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:46.939371971Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}